# Same-origin on purpose. Vercel serves this over HTTPS, and a browser refuses
# to let an HTTPS page call an HTTP endpoint (mixed content), so the console
# cannot talk to the box directly. /api/* is rewritten server-side by Vercel to
# the backend, which keeps every request HTTPS from the browser's point of view
# and keeps the backend's address out of the client bundle.
VITE_API_BASE=/api
